..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : WORKORDER.COMMON.ARCHIVE
.. Author         : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : teamreport
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Functionality  : Defines parameters to create a document using mask context.
.. Needs xbeauf which is a workorder. Sets:
.. xid       = workorder the future document record is linked to
.. xsuch     = prefixed searchword of this workorder
.. xbeldat   = date of this workorder
.. ATTENTION: This program must not call fo command .end. Each error handling
..            must take place outside this fop. Example see ev/VORGANG.SPERR
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue END ? _F|defined(U|xbeauf)
.continue END ?  F|empty(U|xbeauf)
..
.. Declarations
.type text  xsuch        ? _F|defined(U|xsuch)
.type VID99 xid          ? _F|defined(U|xid)
.type text  xbeldat      ? _F|defined(U|xbeldat)
..
.. Common details
.assign U|xid = U|xbeauf^lres
.formula U|xsuch = "BA"  + U|xbeauf^nummer
.formula U|xsuch = 'F|sysinfo(10)^feba' + U|xbeauf^nummer ? _F|empty(F|sysinfo(10)^feba)
.formula U|xbeldat = U|xid^vom
.assign P|dokument = U|xid^doku ? F|defined(U|xid^doku^barcode) & _F|empty(U|xid^doku^barcode)
.copy P|belegart = U|xbeauf^drbelegart ? F|empty(P|belegart)
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
